<v Robbie Brown>So you felt like all the signs-- all the signs were good.
<v Robbie Brown>所以你觉得所有的迹象——所有的迹象都是好的。

00:30:57.290 --> 00:31:13.590
<v Justin Laboy>Oh, of course. I felt all the signs were good because I never got a diss-- a non-sign. So, therefore, I was just like, OK. Everything's good. You know, I know I'm taking it slow. You know, I know I'm taking it good. You know, usually it doesn't take me that long to get a girlfriend when I start talking to them.
<v Justin Laboy>哦，当然。我感觉所有的迹象都是好的，因为我从来没得到过一个否定的信号。所以，因此，我只是觉得，好吧。一切都很好。你知道，我知道我在慢慢来。你知道，我知道我处理得很好。你知道，通常我开始和女生交谈时，不需要花那么久就能交到女朋友。

00:31:13.590 --> 00:31:31.780
<v Justin Laboy>So when it took me-- I found it kind of odd that, you know, I was like, wow, you know, I'm such a great dude, and, you know, we're hanging out, you know? What's the next step, you know? I don't care about sex, or anything. I just want to know if you're going to be mine.
<v Justin Laboy>所以当我花——我觉得有点奇怪，你知道，我当时想，哇，你知道，我是这么好的家伙，而且，你知道，我们在一起玩，你知道？下一步是什么，你知道吗？我不关心性，或者任何事情。我只是想知道你是否会成为我的。

